# Agent scratch. /scratch is deliberately at the repository root so an agent
# running `ls` finds a place to put temporary work when it has not been given a
# better location — a fallback for models that do not reliably follow storage
# guidance. Its contents are disposable by definition, so nothing in it is
# tracked; anything that turns out to be worth keeping must be promoted to a
# real home before it is committed. Anchored so it never matches a scenario's
# own scratch/ directory.
/scratch/
temp/
temp-*/
temp_*/
.tmp/
.tmp-*/
.tmp_*/
.temp/
.temp-*/
.temp_*/
debug/
debug-*/
debug_*/
*.tmp
*.backup
*.bak

